  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - 1.\tThe development hereby permitted shall be completed before the expiration of three years from the date of this decision.",
    "Condition : 2 - 2.\tThe proposals shall be implemented in accordance with the approved plans.",
    "Condition : 3 - 3.\tA) Prior to the commencement of internal works to facilitate the conversion of the building into flats hereby approved, details of a noise insulation scheme to ensure that the occupants of the proposed development shall be protected from external noise sources so that they are not exposed to levels indoors of more than 35 dB LAeq 16 hrs daytime and of more than 30 dB LAeq 8 hrs in bedrooms at night, shall be submitted to an approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. Development shall thereafter be carried out in accordance with the approved details.\r\nB) Prior to Occupation of the development hereby approved, details (including Test reports) to demonstrate that the proposed noise insulation scheme is compliant with the approved standard. This shall be done by carrying out post completion noise tests from within residential accommodation in the converted building and carried out by accredited/approved organisations in accordance with the relevant British Standard. These details shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority and thereafter the development shall be maintained in accordance with the approved details.",
    "Condition : 4 - 4.\tPrior to commencement of works to facilitate the conversion of the building into flats hereby approved construction logistics plan shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The proposal shall be implemented in accordance with the approved details.",
    "Condition : 5 - 5.\tThe development hereby permitted shall not be occupied nor the use commenced until full details of the proposed cycle parking and shelters shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority and the cycle parking shall be implemented prior to first occupation in accordance with the approved plans. The bicycle parking facilities shall thereafter be kept available for the parking of bicycles",
    "Condition : 6 - 6.\tThe development hereby permitted shall not be occupied nor the use commenced until full details of the reduced number of parking spaces compared to the existing on-site provision, referred to within the submitted Transport Assessment Dated July 2018 (including provision of spaces for people with disabilities and any electric vehicle charging points approved), and the access to them have been submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. This provision shall be implemented and permanently retained thereafter and available for the occupiers and users of the premises and used for no other purpose.",
    "Condition : 7 - 7.\tNo part of the development shall be occupied until a car parking management plan has been submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The measures as approved shall be implemented before the first occupation of the development hereby permitted and shall be maintained for the duration of the use unless the prior written approval of the local planning authority is obtained to any variation."
  ],
